meta {
  name: Set which deploys of a repository are production
  type: http
  seq: 52
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/deploy-sources
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "repository": "northwind-cloud/app",
    "production": "always"
  }
}

docs {
  Whether deploys of a linked `repository` are treated as production, which is what decides whether a deploy is verified. `production` is `auto` (the default: a workflow run on the repository's default branch, a GitHub deployment GitHub or its environment name marks as production, and every release), `always` or `never`. Returns the setting with the `default_branch` GitHub last named. 404 for a repository this organization does not link.

  Scope: `monitoring.write`
}
